{"file": "穿越六零之我在山洞闷声发家-第125集.mp4", "ep": 125, "duration": 59.2, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "被这一顿热饭彻底冲散了"}, {"start": 2.91, "end": 3.79, "text": "这就是家"}, {"start": 8.87, "end": 9.71, "text": "秦大哥"}, {"start": 10.35, "end": 11.51, "text": "真的没受伤吗"}, {"start": 13.01, "end": 14.05, "text": "连皮都没破"}, {"start": 14.57, "end": 15.21, "text": "我保证"}, {"start": 15.53, "end": 16.53, "text": "等办完婚事"}, {"start": 16.69, "end": 18.01, "text": "我就安心在厂里上班"}, {"start": 18.21, "end": 18.85, "text": "多陪你"}, {"start": 19.01, "end": 19.73, "text": "少进山"}, {"start": 20.29, "end": 20.65, "text": "嗯"}, {"start": 21.29, "end": 22.69, "text": "我去给你烧热水洗澡"}, {"start": 23.96, "end": 24.84, "text": "水好了"}, {"start": 24.92, "end": 25.84, "text": "你洗吧"}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 26.56, "text": "小夕"}, {"start": 28.18, "end": 28.98, "text": "能遇见你"}, {"start": 29.18, "end": 30.74, "text": "是我这辈子最大的福气"}, {"start": 31.3, "end": 32.14, "text": "等结了婚"}, {"start": 32.5, "end": 33.14, "text": "这个家"}, {"start": 33.46, "end": 34.46, "text": "你来当家做主"}, {"start": 38.04, "end": 38.92, "text": "都听你的"}, {"start": 39.44, "end": 40.76, "text": "水要凉了你快洗"}, {"start": 46.71, "end": 47.39, "text": "真好看"}, {"start": 47.95, "end": 48.67, "text": "送给我吧"}, {"start": 49.07, "end": 50.59, "text": "就当定情信物"}, {"start": 51.7, "end": 52.1, "text": "嗯"}]}